   _Entry.Generated_date                 .
   _Entry.DOI                            .
   _Entry.UUID                           .
   _Entry.Related_coordinate_file_name   .
   _Entry.Details
;
Entry contains assignments of backbone amides as well as of the isopeptide bond formed 
between residue K63 from the proximal ubiquitin and the C-terminus of the distal ubiquitin, 
in K63-linked di-ubiquitin. The chain-terminating mutations needed for controlled enzymatic 
assembly of K63-linked diubiquitin are an aspartate extension at the C terminus of the 
proximal ubiquitin and mutation of residue 63 lysine to arginine in the distal ubiquitin.
;
   _Entry.BMRB_internal_directory_name   .

